OL,3,GNEWSATrains cancelled due to safety
OL,4,Achecks near line
OL,5,
OL,6,FPassengers are facing disruption due to
OL,7,Ftrains being cancelled while police and
OL,8,Frailway workers carry out safety checks
OL,9,Fnear a section of line.
OL,11,FGreater Anglia trains between Norwich
OL,12,Fand Ely, including those running to
OL,13,FStansted Airport via Cambridge, have
OL,14,Fbeen cancelled until about 16:30 BST.
OL,16,FPolice and Network Rail are making the
OL,17,Fchecks near the railway line between
OL,18,FThetford and Harling Road train
OL,19,Fstation, near East Harling, the company
OL,20,Fhas said.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
